# Local scrub list — terms that can't be named in a public file (R&D device names, unfiled
# patent subject matter, feedstock specs, TTP scoring factors). scrub-check loads it if
# present; publishing it would be the disclosure it exists to prevent.
.scrub-private-terms.json

